---
const questions = [
  {
    icon: "🌱",
    text: "kiedy zacząć",
  },
  {
    icon: "📚",
    text: "jakie materiały wybrać",
  },
  {
    icon: "🧭",
    text: "jaką metodę zastosować",
  },
  {
    icon: "☀️",
    text: "jak sprawić, żeby nauka nie zamieniła się w obowiązek",
  },
];
---

<section class="first-steps section" aria-labelledby="first-steps-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="first-steps__intro">
      <h2 class="h2 first-steps__title" id="first-steps-title">
        Pierwsze kroki w nauce czytania nie muszą być trudne
      </h2>
      <p class="first-steps__lead">
        Wielu rodziców chce wspierać swoje dziecko, ale nie wie:
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="first-steps__grid">
      {
        questions.map((question) => (
          <article class="first-steps__card card paper-texture">
            <span class="first-steps__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              {question.icon}
            </span>
            <p class="first-steps__question">{question.text}</p>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <p class="first-steps__summary">
      Dlatego stworzyliśmy gotowe materiały, które możesz wykorzystać od razu.
      Wystarczy wydrukować i zacząć wspólną przygodę z czytaniem.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .first-steps {
  }

  .first-steps__intro {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .first-steps__title {
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .first-steps__lead {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(58, 58, 58, 0.82);
  }

  .first-steps__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.35rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .first-steps__card {
    --note-bg: #f7e89a;
    --note-edge: #ddca67;
    --note-rotation: -1.7deg;

    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-height: 220px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.4rem 1.55rem;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) 0,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 1.15rem,
        transparent 1.15rem
      ),
      var(--note-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(58, 58, 58, 0.07);
    box-shadow:
      0 3px 4px rgba(58, 58, 58, 0.1),
      0 18px 24px rgba(58, 58, 58, 0.1);
    text-align: center;
    transform: rotate(var(--note-rotation));
    transform-origin: center top;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s ease,
      box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .first-steps__card:nth-child(2) {
    --note-bg: #cfe7ca;
    --note-edge: #a9cda3;
    --note-rotation: 1.2deg;
  }

  .first-steps__card:nth-child(3) {
    --note-bg: #efd1d9;
    --note-edge: #d8aab6;
    --note-rotation: -0.8deg;
  }

  .first-steps__card:nth-child(4) {
    --note-bg: #cfe2ee;
    --note-edge: #a7c7d9;
    --note-rotation: 1.7deg;
  }

  .first-steps__card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    right: -1px;
    bottom: -1px;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      transparent 0 49%,
      var(--note-edge) 50% 100%
    );
    filter: drop-shadow(-2px -2px 2px rgba(58, 58, 58, 0.08));
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .first-steps__icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 3.25rem;
    height: 3.25rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
    border: 1px solid rgba(58, 58, 58, 0.08);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(58, 58, 58, 0.08);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
  }

  .first-steps__question {
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(58, 58, 58, 0.86);
  }

  .first-steps__summary {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.35rem 1.5rem;

    background: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .first-steps__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .first-steps__card {
      min-height: 200px;
      max-width: 300px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .first-steps__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .first-steps__card {
      min-height: auto;
      width: calc(100% - 12px);
      margin-inline: auto;
      min-height: 170px;
      max-width: 250px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .first-steps__card {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
